@startuml dyn-release-pipeline
!include include/palette.puml

' Step graph of codefresh/apps/workorders/pipelines/release.yml (spec codefresh/apps/workorders/specs/release.yml),
' with the differences of codefresh/apps/sandbox/pipelines/release.yml in a note.
<style>
activityDiagram {
  activity {
    RoundCorner 8
    FontSize 13
  }
  note {
    FontSize 12
  }
  partition {
    FontColor $C_BUILD_TIER
    LineColor $C_BUILD_TIER
  }
  .step {
    BackgroundColor $C_BUILD_TIER
    FontColor #FFFFFF
    LineColor $C_BUILD_TIER
  }
  .gate {
    BackgroundColor $C_CODEFRESH
    FontColor #FFFFFF
    LineColor $C_CODEFRESH
  }
  .registry {
    BackgroundColor $C_AZURE
    FontColor #FFFFFF
    LineColor $C_AZURE
  }
  .octopus {
    BackgroundColor $C_OCTOPUS
    FontColor #FFFFFF
    LineColor $C_OCTOPUS
  }
  .wake {
    BackgroundColor $C_WAKE
    FontColor #FFFFFF
    LineColor $C_WAKE
  }
  .skipped {
    BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    FontColor $C_EXTERNAL
    LineColor $C_LEGACY
    LineStyle 4
  }
  .github {
    BackgroundColor $C_GITHUB
    FontColor #FFFFFF
    LineColor $C_GITHUB
  }
}
legend {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  LineColor $C_LEGACY
  FontSize 12
}
</style>

title Dynamic: step graph of the app release pipeline, workorders/release (§7.0 Codefresh, §7.7, ADR-IR33)

start
:**master-push trigger**
push.heads of the app repo on master; <<github>>
note right
  Concurrency 1: builds queue and are
  never cancelled. mode: parallel,
  fail_fast: false
end note

partition "stage clone" {
  fork
    :**main_clone**
    app repo at CF_REVISION, full history; <<step>>
  fork again
    :**platform_clone**
    environment repo at main, depth 1; <<step>>
  end fork
}

partition "stage prepare" {
  :**prepare**
  VERSION and CODE_CHANGED; <<step>>
  note right
    version.ps1 on master: 2.5.<height>;
    IS_RELEASE=true
  end note
}

fork
  -> CODE_CHANGED=true;
  :**wake_nonprod**
  run env-wake in infra-nonprod; <<wake>>
  note right
    Fire and forget: one Octopus REST call
    with platform-octopus, timeout 3m;
    every path exits 0, never waits
  end note
  detach
fork again
  :**gates, as in workorders/ci**
  two chains, six gates; <<gate>>
  note right
    After build_sql success, beside the
    other gates: **package** (Package-Everything,
    buildinfo.ps1) and **stage_images**
    (stage-built.ps1). Build volume only;
    nothing leaves the build
  end note
  :**gate**
  trx-summary.ps1, then gate.ps1; <<step>>
end fork

if (gate success, stage_images success
and CODE_CHANGED=true?) then (yes)
  partition "stages images and supply-chain" {
    :**image_reuse**
    supply-chain.ps1 -CheckReuse; <<registry>>
    note right
      Reads writeEnabled of the six tags.
      Mixed state (some locked): the step
      and the build fail
    end note
    if (IMAGES_REUSED?) then (false: no tag locked)
      fork
        :**ui_image**; <<registry>>
      fork again
        :**worker_image**; <<registry>>
      fork again
        :**migrator_image**; <<registry>>
      end fork
      note right
        type build, registry acr-apps-release;
        apps/workorders/<image>:<VERSION>
        and sha-<sha7>; cosign.sign keyless
      end note
      :**supply_chain**
      SBOM, provenance, tag lock; <<registry>>
    else (true: every tag locked, a re-run)
      :**supply_chain_reuse**
      confirms the lock, names the digests; <<registry>>
    endif
  }
  partition "stage handoff" {
    -> when.steps.any: supply_chain
    or supply_chain_reuse success;
    :**octopus_preflight**
    context check, no network call; <<octopus>>
    :**octopus_packages**
    upload ChurchBulletin.AcceptanceTests; <<octopus>>
    :**octopus_build_info**
    four package IDs, HEAD^1..HEAD; <<octopus>>
    :**octopus_release**
    release VERSION, channel Default; <<octopus>>
    note right
      Project workorders; one explicit ~--package
      per package, no default package version;
      ~--git-ref refs/heads/main; ~--release-notes-file;
      ~--ignore-existing
    end note
  }
else (no: docs-only or failed gate)
  :image_reuse and every later step
  skipped; nothing is released; <<skipped>>
endif

:**on_finish hook**
prints the test and gate summaries; <<step>>
:**codefresh/release**
status of the build; never deploys; <<github>>
stop

floating note left
  **sandbox/release differs:**
  trigger main of <sandbox-app-repo>;
  VERSION 0.1.<height>;
  wake_nonprod on every main build;
  build_test instead of the gates and gate;
  no package and no octopus_packages;
  images web and migrator;
  octopus_build_info runs buildinfo.ps1;
  a release with two packages
end note

legend right
  <back:$C_BUILD_TIER>      </back> Pipeline step (strict_fail_fast)
  <back:$C_CODEFRESH>      </back> Gates (strict_fail_fast; security_scan advisory)
  <back:$C_WAKE>      </back> Early wake: no strict_fail_fast, never fails the build
  <back:$C_AZURE>      </back> Registry and Sigstore work (token cf-apps-release)
  <back:$C_OCTOPUS>      </back> Octopus handoff (Space Manager key, platform-octopus)
  <back:#FFFFFF><color:$C_LEGACY>- - -</color></back> Skipped
  <back:$C_GITHUB>      </back> GitHub trigger and commit status
endlegend
@enduml
